This is the file .../info/dir, which contains the
topmost node of the Info hierarchy, called (dir)Top.
The first time you invoke Info you start off looking at this node.

File: dir,	Node: Top	This is the top of the INFO tree

  This (the Directory node) gives a menu of major topics.
  Typing "q" exits, "H" lists all Info commands, "d" returns here,
  "h" gives a primer for first-timers,
  "mEmacs<Return>" visits the Emacs manual, etc.

  In Emacs, you can click mouse button 2 on a menu item or cross reference
  to select it.

* Menu:

系统管理
* Guix 烹饪书: (guix-cookbook.zh_CN).
                                GNU Guix 的教程和示例。
* Guix.zh_CN: (guix.zh_CN).     管理安装的软件和系统配置。
* guix deploy: (guix.zh_CN) 调用 guix deploy.
                                Manage operating system configurations for 
                                  remote hosts.
* guix gc：(guix.zh_CN) 调用 guix gc.
                                回收不使用的硬盘空间。
* guix package: (guix.zh_CN) 调用 guix package.
                                安装、删除和升级软件包。
* guix pull: (guix.zh_CN) 调用 guix pull.
                                更新可用的软件包列表。
* guix system: (guix.zh_CN) 调用 guix system.
                                管理操作系统配置。

软件开发
* guix build: (guix.zh_CN) 调用 guix build.
                                构建软件包。
* guix environment: (guix.zh_CN) 调用 guix environment.
                                用 Guix 构建开发环境。
* guix pack: (guix.zh_CN) 调用 guix pack.
                                创建二进制 bundle。
* guix shell: (guix.zh_CN) 调用 guix shell.
                                Creating software environments.
